<title>USA: SDB of China sets $330 mln 10-year notes.</title>
<headline>SDB of China sets $330 mln 10-year notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from State Development of China was priced on Wednesday, according to joint lead manager JP Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER STATE DEVELOPMENT BANK OF CHINA</p>
<p>AMT $330 MLN	 COUPON 7.375 PCT  MATURITY 2/01/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.734  FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 7.413 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 80 BPS     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate bond unit 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
